<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups AGCO Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill ups AGCO Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near- and long-term ratings on AGCO Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was not immediately open after closing Tuesday at 28-1/2.</p>
</text>
